From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ninjacornix <milanvrankic@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 02:18:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(editor): one header for start screens, aligned setup
 edges

The wordmark sits in one page header at the page's content inset on the connect, API key and project screens. The setup wizard's footer ends on the page's right edge, the page fades out above the footer, disclosures start their chevron on the content edge, and the catalog banner offers Retry as a button beside Details with plain copy.

Joinery-only start screen and setup flow, not intended for upstream.
